il he returns the following day  a new batch of soldiers arrive at their  post lieutenant marina reveals that the  forensic reports of the quarantine zone  dead bodies have just been published it  says the cause of the death is  neurotoxin poisoning produced by the  body itself this means the people were  killed because something triggered their  bodies to produce the toxin abnormally  oleg and his girlfriend elena are at  their post getting ready to deploy to a  quarantine zone for research however  their plan is interrupted by the sudden  ringing of alarms the radar shows that  something massive is coming their way  from the forest the soldiers have no  view of the enemy so they settle on  firing in random directions the scene  cuts to the next morning and we finally  get to see the chaos in broad daylight  the attackers were wild bears who killed  and devoured many of the soldiers and  wreaked havoc on the base the incident  is devastating but also strange because  the bears seemed to have attacked  strategically in another part of the  city a man named sasha is hospitalized  since the blackout occurred something  strange has been happening to sasha as  he sees vivid dreams and hears voices in  his head the morning after the attack  sasha feels uneasy almost as if he can  feel the soldiers fear when they fought  the bears he is then approached by a man  named zhenya who claims to be his ally  he reveals that many people are still  alive in the quarantine zones but are  being controlled by someone sasha is  also connected to their minds because he  was at the border of the circle of life  when the blackout occurred this explains  his dreams and also the bear attack  which was an elaborate plan devised by  the person who is controlling everything  zhenya doesn't disclose how he knows all  of this which causes sasha to panic he  calls the guards but finds out he has  been talking to zhenya in his mind and  he is not physically present in the room  ghosts blackouts and bears oh my  sorry that was a stupid joke meanwhile  in the army base multiple teams of  soldiers set off for different parts of  the quarantined zones for their  respective missions a few hours later  the first team reaches a quarantined  city where the plane had crashed to  their surprise they are welcomed by the  surviving humans who are now a puppet to  someone else they are waiting with tanks  arms and ammunition ready to fight the  soldiers soldier yuri and the second  team are with a press reporter named  olia they reach a town safely where they  have to establish an observation camp  for the next few days meanwhile oleg is  with group three entering a city called  kirov a few days pass and the soldiers  continue keeping watch in their  respective areas then one day a man  named ide approaches sasha and reveals  himself to be a humanoid alien he wants  to use sasha's psychic abilities to find  the perpetrator of the blackout who is  none other than ide's brother raw seems  like sasha is hallucinating [ __ ] again  the lieutenant catches eyed and arrests  them after he promises to explain  everything he knows about the blackout a  while later everyone is in the  interrogation room waiting for ide to  speak he starts by revealing that he and  his people are natives of a planet in a  different galaxy they never age after a  certain point and cannot die of natural  causes until someone kills them when  their planet's sun died they had to  relocate to a better one with a younger  son they chose the earth and sent ide  and his brother raw to the planet to  make it ready by the time everyone else  arrives on a bigger ship two hundred  thousand years ago when ide and raw came  to the earth humans used to possess  psionic powers and could use telepathy  and psychosis this is how they created  pyramids and other unexplained  infrastructures of the world such powers  could be a problem for id's kind when  they came to earth so raw and i'd used a  bio weapon to make t