vivors remain him and  olia they have to find another group if  they wish to stay alive hence they get  on a vehicle and make their way to  oleg's team elsewhere eid is helping  sasha focus so they can figure out where  raw is located after trying for a while  sasha finally sees him on top of a  skyscraper in kirov controlling the  human puppets i'd help sasha calm down  and suggests they quickly leave for  kirov it is also the place where oleg is  stationed and where olya and yuri are  headed ide and the team are preparing to  leave when they are informed that the  puppets have attacked the circle of life  as well not wasting more time i'd the  lieutenant and her soldiers leave for  kirov sasha is asked to stay at the base  because his life must not be put at risk  on their way to kirov ide reveals that  he doesn't care about sasha's life he  asked the guy to stay back because raw  could track his location which would  mean trouble for all of them as he had  predicted raw finds sasha's location  resulting in several missiles being  launched at the base the soldiers try  their best to fight back but eventually  the entire base is destroyed and  everyone inside is killed the lieutenant  loses her mind and blames eyed for  killing her people i'd on the other hand  claims that this was the only way they  could run away from raw without him  becoming suspicious the soldier's death  was inevitable and frankly necessary to  save humanity the following morning yuri  and olia find oleg's team and a while  later the lieutenant and her group also  join the soldiers are told everything  about ide and the attack on the circle  of life this means that they are the  only humans alive on earth and they have  to stop raw to prevent humanity's  extinction they do not waste more time  before making their way to the  skyscraper where the villain is but on  the way their tanks are attacked by a  massive crowd of human puppets one man  jumps on a vehicle with an explosive and  initiates the battle the soldiers remain  inside the tank and fire at the crowd in  front of them they do not stop so the  enemy won't get a chance to climb the  tanks and eventually reach the  skyscraper the commander and his  soldiers decide to remain at the bottom  of the building to deflect the enemy  while the others climb upstairs in a  final showdown yuri and i'd come face to  face with raw yuri runs to attack him  but raw is much stronger he instead  faces a better opponent his brother aide  they fight an intense battle both as  good as each other meanwhile the  commander is struggling to hold off the  puppets when most of his soldiers have  died they are attacked by a vehicle  filled with explosives it causes an  explosion resulting in the deaths of all  soldiers the puppets are now free to  enter the building to their master's aid  raw figures out what is going on  downstairs but it distracts him giving  eyed a chance to land a fatal attack he  rips out a device from ra's chest and  thrusts a grenade into it killing his  brother at last after his death eyed  gains full control over the puppets and  kills them at once now the only humans  alive are yuri oleg the lieutenant olya  alina and jenya they do not feel the joy  of victory as billions of dead bodies  lie all around ide finally reveals that  humans are irrational beings with no  love and compassion even when they show  mercy they will choose a path of  violence one day or the other this is  why raw wanted to end them as a species  and ensure his people's safety they've  clearly demonstrated that they're not  violent at all however i'd has a  different motive he wants to be god and  craves absolute power he could have  warned people long ago about the  blackout but he only came into action  after it happened this is because he  wanted humans to die so they know his  importance and see him as their messiah  an enraged lieutenant holds him at  gunpoint accusing him of killing  billions just for his fantasy before she  shoots zhenya runs at ide with a knife  eid positions himself away from both of  them just in time for zhenya to stab the  lieutenant she is killed in the incident  ide turns himself into oleg's father to  confuse him but jenya sees through his  plan this time he throws him from the  roof dying with him in the fall now the  only people alive are an injured yuri  oleg olya and elena everything falls  silent as they watch an alien spaceship  land on earth the door to the ship opens  and they patiently wait for the invaders  but to their surprise no one comes out  they decide to go inside themselves and  find thousands of aliens sleeping in  cryocapsules they're about to wake up in  a few minutes so the group starts  destroying their oxygen supply to kill  them at last we're dead anyway they say  may as well commit genocide however when  they get to the children's section they  cannot bring themselves to kill the  innocent kids in the last scene hundreds  of alien children come out of the  capsule ready to explore their new home  without parents or guidance of any kind  real nice subscribe for more videos like  this turn on notifications and leave a  like to help the channel out thank you  for watching

